    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 - DISCOVER\n\nOutscraper works one zip cluster a morning and pulls the buildings that actually buy cleaning. Nobody uploads a list.",
        "height": 780,
        "width": 1420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "453bc761-6c68-5a7b-ba9a-1dfdeb56dc50",
      "name": "Section - 1 - DISCOVER",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 - ENRICH\n\nApollo turns a building into a named facilities or office manager with a verified email. No name, no guessing, it parks.",
        "height": 780,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "f1c43090-3acb-58da-88b0-46a1456c304c",
      "name": "Section - 2 - ENRICH",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1520,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3 - RESEARCH AND SCORE\n\nThe agent reads the site and the Google profile, then scores the account on size, foot traffic, vendor signals and hiring.",
        "height": 780,
        "width": 1160,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "5ac606d7-7c5f-59db-92f9-e2da01e26279",
      "name": "Section - 3 - RESEARCH AND SCORE",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2420,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4 - HUMAN APPROVAL, THEN THE CRM\n\nNothing reaches HighLevel until a human says yes. The morning list posts to Slack, one tap approves, one tap rejects with a reason.",
        "height": 780,
        "width": 1180,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "ca913ab2-c3e9-5a47-ac60-a754d3424f03",
      "name": "Section - 4 - HUMAN APPROVAL, THEN THE CRM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3740,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 5 - LOGS, DEDUPE, ALERTS\n\nPostgres is the dedupe key, by place id and normalized phone, so the same building never shows up twice. Every failure names its node.",
        "height": 780,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 1
      },
